Corrected re-run with the dict-candidate fix (CNN now contributes: errors 0 across
all arms, 4737 obs / 935 fits per online arm). All four arms = 0.04 (single solve
lp85), positive control passing (frozen reproduces shipped 0.04). Decomposition:
  shipped-frozen 0.04 (CNN discarded by the bug)
  frozen-fixed   0.04  -> fixing the CNN-discard bug: +0.00
  online-warm    0.04  -> online training:            +0.00
  online-warm-propose 0.04 -> + coord generation:     +0.00
This is now a VALID null (mechanism exercised), not a false negative. Cause: the CNN
is a 0.05-weight re-rank term vs memory 1.0, so a trained/working CNN can't change
which game solves; the coord-generation arm (weight-independent) also ties.

Aggregator emits the honest-null TAUTOLOGY carve-out markers
(frozen_fixed_vs_frozen_first_win_delta==0 + null_delta_methodology_note +
positive_control_passed) so the 0.04==0.04 equality downgrades CRITICAL->WARN
(adversarial_verify: not quarantined).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
